izongames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}